  "prefLabel": "Csp 405.04 Award Transfer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Csp 405.04 Award Transfer. An eligible student shall not transfer his or her governor’s scholarship award to another postsecondary institution, unless the eligible student initially attends a community college and then transfers directly to a participating eligible institution without a break in attendance. Such student shall remain an eligible student for a maximum of 4 years of total eligibility.\n\nSource. #13144, eff 12-9-20 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Csp 400); ss by #13302, eff 12-10-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/csp100-700.html"
